  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Proof that downsizing doesn't mean compromising. Our Stash small carryall is crafted in pebbled leather with a magnetic snap closure, interior zip pocket, and dual straps that switch from shoulder to crossbody. (Because, dinner reservations.) It fits more than you'd expect and looks good doing it. Plus, it's microfiber-lined—what's inside counts.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Pebbled leather</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> KS microfiber lining</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Gold hardware (black, bungalow); silver hardware (crisp sky, star fruit, tutu pink)</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Removeable and adjustable crossbody strap with 22&quot; drop</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: 1 zip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Snap closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 9.6&quot; (L) x 4.9&quot; (H) x 4.50&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
